#: source/release-notes/rl-1.4.md:1
msgid "Release 1.4 (2013-02-26)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-1.4.md:3
msgid ""
"This release fixes a security bug in multi-user operation. It was possible "
"for derivations to cause the mode of files outside of the Nix store to be "
"changed to 444 (read-only but world-readable) by creating hard links to "
"those files ([details](https://github.com/NixOS/nix/"
"commit/5526a282b5b44e9296e61e07d7d2626a79141ac4))."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-1.4.md:9
msgid "There are also the following improvements:"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-1.4.md:11
msgid "New built-in function: `builtins.hashString`."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-1.4.md:13
msgid ""
"Build logs are now stored in `/nix/var/log/nix/drvs/XX/`, where _XX_ is the "
"first two characters of the derivation. This is useful on machines that keep "
"a lot of build logs (such as Hydra servers)."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-1.4.md:17
msgid ""
"The function `corepkgs/fetchurl` can now make the downloaded file "
"executable. This will allow getting rid of all bootstrap binaries in the "
"Nixpkgs source tree."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-1.4.md:21
msgid ""
"Language change: The expression `\"${./path}         ...\"` now evaluates to "
"a string instead of a path."
msgstr ""
